cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Glassbox in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Glassbox: telemetry-driven differentiable vehicle dynamics identification"
authors:
  - family-names: Lillibridge
    given-names: Ryland
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rylandl/glassbox"
abstract: >-
  Glassbox learns differentiable multirotor and fixed-wing dynamics from
  recorded state and actuator telemetry, represents the fitted model as a
  dynamics belief with held-out predictive error and parameter uncertainty,
  and supports online belief adaptation, bootstrap identification, and
  belief-aware nonlinear model-predictive control.
keywords:
  - system identification
  - differentiable dynamics
  - JAX
  - PX4
  - model predictive control
